* text=auto

*.cs text diff=csharp
*.razor text
*.js text
*.mjs text
*.css text
*.json text
*.md text
*.csproj text
*.props text
*.targets text
*.slnx text
*.yml text

*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.snupkg binary
*.nupkg binary
